   prompt| - `d <number>` / `details <number>` - show technical IDs and details
   prompt| - `park <session-number-or-id>` / `resume <session-number-or-id>` / `unpark <session-number-or-id>` - manually pause or resume polling for a Work chat
   prompt| - `fork <session>` - copy a session into a new Work chat
   prompt| - `m <directory>` / `mkdir <directory>` - create a directory only
   prompt| - `ask <question>` - ask a quick helper question in this control chat
